      },
      {
       "text": "・Gave CPUs the ability to plan for talent skills.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Adjusted the effects of the talent skill \"Carefree Cat.\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "1 Type: 10% → 10%",
