  {
   "id": "hololive-holo-s-hanafuda-339960@1.3.0",
   "gameId": "hololive-holo-s-hanafuda-339960",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.3.0",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-11-10T03:44:44.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45451542/c50cc5611e1ea1453f6eae4eb18f83af30cd7b92.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Update Patch (Ver 1.3.0) has been released.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The following add-on has been activated: Holo's Hanafuda DLC: La+ Darknesss & Kazama Iroha Set",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added an option to enable a timer which limits the length of time players can input commands during lobby matches.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added an option to adjust the size of bento stickers.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased the maximum number of stickers that can be placed on a bento from 10 to 30.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted the talent skill \"You-re Mine!\".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Previously, the skill transferred 30% of the table score to your own score. Now, this skill instead transfers 25% of your opponent's score to the table score. This skill previously reduced the table score, which also reduced the risk of performing a koi-koi. However, this also made it difficult to turn the tables on your opponent during the end game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This skill was intended to offer players the potential to trigger epic last-minute comebacks, so it was changed to fulfill this role.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted the effects of the talent skill \"Big God Mion.\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "The percentage each card increased your score by has been raised from 1% to 4%. Previously, this skill had less potential than other talent skill's for increasing score, and so this change was made to hopefully balance it out a little bit better.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Minor bug fixes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Finally, we are scheduled to release the third DLC set, \"La+ Darknesss & Kazama Iroha\" the day after tomorrow, November 13th (JST). We sincerely hope you will enjoy this as well.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We will continue to make improvements to ensure everyone can enjoy a more comfortable gaming experience. We look forward to your continued support of \"Holo's Hanafuda\".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
